<title>FRANCE: State ups SNCF rail debt spin-off to 134.2 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>State ups SNCF rail debt spin-off to 134.2 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French government plans to spin off 134.2 billion francs of the SNCF railways' debts into the state holding company that will become rail infrastructure owner under an SNCF reform plan, the Senate economic affairs committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It originally planned to spin off 125 billion francs.</p>
</text>
